{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:0030583","isObsolete":false,"name":"myxococcal fruiting body development","definition":{"text":"The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the myxococcal fruiting body over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The process begins when myxococci respond to a lack of nutrients in the environment and ends when the myxococcal fruiting body is a mature structure.","xrefs":[{"dbCode":"ISBN","dbId":"0815316194"},{"dbCode":"PMID","dbId":"11121786"}]},"comment":"For example, as seen in myxobacterium. It is not intended to describe fruiting body development as is Dictyostelium.","synonyms":[{"name":"fruiting body development in cellular response to starvation","type":"broad"},{"name":"fruiting body development in response to starvation","type":"broad"}],"secondaryIds":["GO:0055084"],"history":[{"timestamp":"2022-02-17","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0032502 (developmental process)"},{"timestamp":"2022-02-17","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044764 (obsolete multi-organism cellular process)"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0048869 (cellular developmental process)"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0042594 (response to starvation)"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0055084 (fruiting body development in response to starvation)"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044702 (single organism reproductive process)"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044764 (obsolete multi-organism cellular process)"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0009267 (cellular response to starvation)"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"fruiting body development in cellular response to starvation"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"fruiting body development in response to starvation"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Added","category":"DEFINITION","text":"The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the myxococcal fruiting body over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The process begins when myxococci respond to a lack of nutrients in the environment and ends when the myxococcal fruiting body is a mature structure."},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Deleted","category":"DEFINITION","text":"The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the fruiting body over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The process begins when cells respond to a lack of nutrients in the environment and ends when the fruiting body is a mature structure."},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Added","category":"SECONDARY","text":"GO:0055084 (fruiting body development in response to starvation)"},{"timestamp":"2015-05-24","action":"Updated","category":"TERM","text":"myxococcal fruiting body development"},{"timestamp":"2014-07-30","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0048610 (obsolete cellular process involved in reproduction)"},{"timestamp":"2013-11-28","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044702 (single organism reproductive process)"},{"timestamp":"2010-03-04","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0048610 (obsolete cellular process involved in reproduction)"},{"timestamp":"2009-08-15","action":"Deleted","category":"SYNONYM","text":"fruiting body development (sensu Bacteria)"},{"timestamp":"2009-08-15","action":"Deleted","category":"SYNONYM","text":"fruiting body formation (sensu Bacteria)"},{"timestamp":"2008-05-13","action":"Added","category":"DEFINITION","text":"The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the fruiting body over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The process begins when cells respond to a lack of nutrients in the environment and ends when the fruiting body is a mature structure."},{"timestamp":"2008-05-12","action":"Deleted","category":"DEFINITION","text":"The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the fruiting body over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The process begins when cells respond to a lack of nutrients in the environment and ends when the fruiting body is a mature structure."},{"timestamp":"2008-04-01","action":"Updated","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0009267 (cellular response to starvation)"},{"timestamp":"2008-04-01","action":"Updated","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0048869 (cellular developmental process)"},{"timestamp":"2008-04-01","action":"Updated","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0055084 (fruiting body development in response to starvation)"},{"timestamp":"2007-10-25","action":"Updated","category":"DEFINITION","text":"The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the fruiting body over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The process begins when cells respond to a lack of nutrients in the environment and ends when the fruiting body is a mature structure."},{"timestamp":"2007-10-17","action":"Updated","category":"TERM","text":"fruiting body development in cellular response to starvation"},{"timestamp":"2007-10-17","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"fruiting body development (sensu Bacteria)"},{"timestamp":"2007-08-09","action":"Deleted","category":"SYNONYM","text":"fruiting body formation (sensu Bacteria)"},{"timestamp":"2007-08-09","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"fruiting body formation (sensu Bacteria)"},{"timestamp":"2007-01-20","action":"Added","category":"SYNONYM","text":"fruiting body formation (sensu Bacteria)"},{"timestamp":"2007-01-20","action":"Updated","category":"TERM","text":"fruiting body development (sensu Bacteria)"},{"timestamp":"2007-01-18","action":"Updated","category":"TERM","text":"fruiting body formation (sensu Bacteria)"},{"timestamp":"2007-01-15","action":"Updated","category":"TERM","text":"fruiting body formation (sensu the Bacteria research community)"},{"timestamp":"2004-08-13","action":"Updated","category":"DEFINITION","text":"Formation of a fruiting body by aggregation of individual cells; a starvation response observed in myxobacteria. As in, but not restricted to, the taxon Bacteria (Bacteria, ncbi_taxonomy_id:2)."},{"timestamp":"2004-02-24","action":"Updated","category":"DEFINITION","text":"Formation of a fruiting body by aggregation of individual cells; a starvation response observed in myxobacteria. As in, but not restricted to, the taxon Eubacteria (Bacteria, ncbi_taxonomy_id:2)."},{"timestamp":"2002-11-27","action":"Added","category":"DEFINITION","text":"Formation of a fruiting body by aggregation of individual bacterial cells; a starvation response observed in myxobacteria."},{"timestamp":"2002-03-13","action":"Added","category":"TERM","text":"fruiting body formation (sensu Bacteria)"}],"aspect":"biological_process","usage":"Unrestricted","blacklist":[{"goId":"GO:0030583","reason":"1 NOT-qualified manual annotation exists with evidence code ECO:0000266 from this reference: GO_REF:0000121","category":"NOT-qualified manual","entityType":"protein","entityId":"P55090","taxonId":"10116","entityName":"UCN1_RAT","ancestorGoId":"GO:0042594"},{"goId":"GO:0030583","reason":"1 NOT-qualified manual annotation exists with evidence code ECO:0000315 from this reference: PMID:12091910","category":"NOT-qualified manual","entityType":"protein","entityId":"P81615","taxonId":"10090","entityName":"UCN1_MOUSE","ancestorGoId":"GO:0042594"}]}],"pageInfo":null}